  "pre_gate_answer": "# Briefing\n\n## Conclusion\n**The questionnaire does not specify a numeric maximum single-position size** for a private credit interval fund.\n\n## What the Evidence Shows\n- The Calamos/Aksia Private Markets Due Diligence Questionnaire asks:\n  - **“What is the maximum and average position size as a percentage of fund assets?”**\n- It also asks related diversification questions, including:\n  - how much of the portfolio is expected to be invested in the **top 10 positions** as a percentage of fund assets.\n\n## Interpretation\n- These are **due diligence questions for the manager**, not prescribed portfolio limits.\n- The provided excerpt does **not** give a recommended, required, or target cap.\n\n## Bottom Line\n**No stated position cap** can be identified from the provided material, so the maximum single-position size **cannot be determined from this evidence alone**.",
